# Check out every file byte-for-byte as stored, on every platform.
#
# Bundled datasets, replication inputs and Dynare references are authenticated
# by SHA-256 (ENIGH, Romer-Romer 2010, SW07, dynare_live). Windows runners
# default to core.autocrlf=true, which rewrote LF to CRLF on checkout and made
# every one of those checks fail there. Some raw sources are stored with CRLF
# on purpose, so no normalization is applied in either direction.
* -text
